            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- The sentence opens by repeating information from the preceding sentence, which mentions both the team and its players. It then tells us something new: that these players cheered the city and charmed the country.",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                747,
                772,
